    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CTA can show PE severity, for ex by the size of the Rt ventricle or reflux into the hepatic veins"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
