    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mech: a lrg Emb occluding major pulm arteries (or many smaller emboli occluding much of the dist bed) raises RV P, which may lead to acute RV failure, shock or sudden death"
     }
    ]
   },
